# Project Rules Index

This document describes which project-specific rules should be added to the context memory or not

**Important**: relative paths are from project root path.

```yml
always:
    - # Only subdirectory index.mdc files (if any exist)
```

**Schema:**

```yml
always:
    - # Subdirectory indexes only - no individual .mdc files
```

